tand Multilingual Speech via Multi-Instructional Training\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.10922\n     [authors=Pavel Denisov, Ngoc Thang Vu | published=2024-04-16 | primary_category=cs.CL | id=2404.10922]\n\n=== openreview (5 results) ===\n  1. \n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=NxvYGS6Go5\n     [authors= | rank=1 | id=NxvYGS6Go5]\n  2. \n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=5zuZWJE2JZ\n     [authors= | rank=2 | id=5zuZWJE2JZ]\n  3. \n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=cIbaLoXOzW\n     [authors= | rank=3 | id=cIbaLoXOzW]\n  4. \n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=wEzBitY5zv\n     [authors= | rank=4 | id=wEzBitY5zv]\n  5. \n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=m9KaysQ1VG\n     [authors= | rank=5 | id=m9KaysQ1VG]\n\n=== exa (5 results) ===\n  1. Teaching a Multilingual Large Language Model to Understand ...\n     https://github.com/DigitalPhonetics/bloomzmms\n     # Repository: DigitalPhonetics/bloomzmms ... Materials for the publication \"Teaching a Multilingual Large Language Model to Understand Multilingual Speech via Multi-Instructional Training\" ... # Teach...\n  2. Teaching a Multilingual Large Language Model to Understand Multilingual Speech via Multi-Instructional Training\n     https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2404.10922", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
